    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given an array of meeting time intervals `[start, end]`, decide whether one person could attend **all** of them — that is, whether no two meetings overlap. A meeting that ends at 10 doesn't clash with one that starts at 10."
    },
